      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a really intense way to put it—\"insidious power.\" i'm interested in the part where you said they \"deliberately obstruct\" climate policies. do you think there's a legitimate economic case for keeping coal, or do you think those arguments are just manufactured by the industry to protect their money?",
